window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The final battle begins. </p> <p>The Xaros Masters destroyed Bastion, the Alliance against the alien invaders has failed. Earth stands against the full force of the enemy's unending drone fleets. </p> <p>With their backs against the wall, Captain Valdar and the Breitenfeld must lead a last ditch mission to end the war against the Xaros. </p> <p>Can humanity pay the price for ultimate victory? </p>"; 
